    # special_expit, same 1-read/1-write fp32-compute body) on GCU400:
    #   tiny shapes want the exact next_pow2 tile; mid shapes peak at 32768;
    #   the 512M bucket splits by dtype -- 2-byte elements gain ~2% from
    #   131072 while fp32 loses, so only 2-byte dtypes widen there.
